# Part of the contract library of jvmcontract's own checker (lib/models/contracts/README.md): contracts for its gaps,
# checked once and recorded in checked.json, which runs under --gaps advised apply without checking them again.
kind: gap-contracts

jdk-static-method:java.lang.Integer.numberOfTrailingZeros(I)I@jdk-25.0.4.1
  call: java.lang.Integer.numberOfTrailingZeros(int i) -> int
  assert: (i == 0 && result == 32) || (i != 0 && 0 <= result && result < 32 && ((i >>> result) & 1) == 1 && (i & ((1 << result) - 1)) == 0)
  modifies: nothing
  written-by: an agent (Claude Opus 5.5), from the documentation of Integer.numberOfTrailingZeros(int): 32 for zero, else the zeros below the lowest one bit
